From a7ad4be6a8e9daf871cb5ff318c444d0c0d935c5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 15:19:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add CRM board layer: statuses, assignee, labels, deadline
 reminders

Local implementation of TenderPlan's 'tags + responsible + calendar'
product idea (docs/TENDERPLAN_BENCHMARK.md, section 7), built from
scratch on top of our own SQLite schema.

- tender_board / tender_labels tables (additive, no breaking migration)
- src/crm/board.py: TenderBoard with a validated status workflow
  (new -> reviewing -> participating -> docs_preparation -> submitted ->
  waiting_result -> won/lost/skipped), assignee, labels, list_by_status,
  and upcoming_deadlines() for Telegram deadline reminders
- tests/test_crm_board.py: 8 tests covering transitions, force override,
  labels, assignment, per-status listing, and deadline windowing

Note: pre-existing failure in
tests/test_database_notification_fingerprint.py::test_legacy_repair_preserves_existing_notification_history
was verified present on HEAD before this change (unrelated to this commit).
